[00:00.000] 作词 : STOLEN秘密行动
[00:01.000] 作曲 : STOLEN秘密行动
[00:02.000] 编曲 : STOLEN秘密行动
[00:10.615]I heard a buzz, but no voices
[00:14.147]Electric dreams, no real choices
[00:17.578]Scroll and swipe, no time to stop and breathe
[00:24.738]Brick by brick, pushing edges
[00:27.837]Empty words, empty pledges
[00:31.321]We fight for truth that we will never know
[00:51.947]The whole world feels cacophonic
[00:55.378]We sleepwalk, half-neurotic
[00:58.778]They fill up screens with nonsense till it swallows,
[01:03.562]swallows every words
[01:33.191]Sure thing we are collapsing
[01:36.507]Decay like sound unfolding
[01:39.822]Who makes this random Blaring?
[01:42.858]Scratching, beeping through the night
[01:46.791]The sure thing now we’re falling
[01:50.109]Into this system stalling
[01:53.525]We shine with empty signals
[01:56.641]Just pretending we’re damn alright
[02:41.071]Cacophony covers light
[02:54.436]Half-neurotic shapes our life
[03:08.771]We fall through depths inside
[03:22.023]No way out, no place to hide—we fall, cacophonic deep inside
[04:32.599]作曲：STOLEN秘密行动
